{"id":"vod_bf_43570","vodId":"43570","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"幽游白书","name_cn":"幽游白书","date":"1992-01-01","year":"1992","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-44/60000af1642600f1fac662813ce06a34.jpg"},"summary":"皿屋敷中学的不良少年浦饭幽助终日无所事事，或与青梅竹马雪村萤子吵架拌嘴，或拿死对头桑原和真出气。某日，逃课玩耍的幽助从车轮下救起一位小姑娘，自己则被汽车撞死。他的举动出乎灵界的预料，因此得到一个复活的机会。经过一次次的考验，幽助最终在萤子和桑原的帮助下重返人间。　　在此之后，他成为一名灵界侦探，专门负责各种奇异的犯罪事件。在一次任务中，幽助又结识了化名南野秀一的妖狐藏马和盗贼飞影。所谓不打不相识，幽助、桑原、藏马、飞影成为共同进退的搭档。他们一同参加了云集强大妖怪的暗黑武术大会，与恐怖的户愚吕兄弟一决胜负。以此为肇始，此后他们与魔界的纠葛越来越深，战斗愈加激烈……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,喜剧,动作,动画,惊悚,冒险"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-04-29 23:10:22","classic":true,"classicRank":40,"franchise":"幽游白书","playable":true,"episodeCount":112,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyoubaishu/第13集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf3.com/video/youyo